      "update_freq_unit": "minute",
      "source": "雙北停車點位整併資料",
      "short_desc": "地圖同時顯示雙北停車場與路邊停車格，圓大小表達容量，綠到灰表達已佔程度。",
      "long_desc": "雙北地圖同時呈現停車場與路邊停車格精確點位；停車場以較大圓突出容量，路邊停車格以較小圓補足單格位置，圖表則比較各類型在不同點位種類中的供給量。",
      "use_case": "先看雙北整體點位供給密度，再以圖表篩出車位類型並回看地圖。",
      "links": ["https://data.taipei/", "https://data.ntpc.gov.tw/", "https://tdx.transportdata.tw/"],
      "contributors": ["codex"],
      "query_chart": "SELECT type_reference AS x_axis, facility_kind_label AS y_axis, SUM(capacity_total)::float AS data FROM public.tran_parking_supply_points_metrotaipei GROUP BY type_reference, facility_kind_label ORDER BY x_axis, array_position(ARRAY['停車場','路邊車格'], facility_kind_label)"
    },
