      "update_freq_unit": "minute",
      "source": "雙北停車點位整併資料",
      "short_desc": "地圖以價格熱區呈現高價停車點位，顏色越熱代表費率越高。",
      "long_desc": "臺北市價格地圖以精確停車點位為基礎，把高價停車場與路邊格位聚成熱區；圖表則比較不同價格級距在停車場與路邊停車格中的供給量。",
      "use_case": "適合先找出價格偏高的熱點區，再看該區是停車場還是路邊停車格主導。",
      "links": ["https://data.taipei/", "https://tdx.transportdata.tw/"],
      "contributors": ["codex"],
      "query_chart": "SELECT price_tier_label AS x_axis, facility_kind_label AS y_axis, SUM(capacity_total)::float AS data FROM public.tran_parking_supply_points_metrotaipei WHERE city = 'taipei' AND price_tier <> 'unknown' GROUP BY price_tier_label, facility_kind_label ORDER BY array_position(ARRAY['免費/未收費','低價','中價','高價','極高價'], price_tier_label), array_position(ARRAY['停車場','路邊車格'], facility_kind_label)"
    },
